		// lightmap, color2 = third stage). The lightmap texel is stored
		// byte-verbatim now (R_ColorShiftLightingBytes no longer << 1's
		// it); the 2.0x happens here, in linear domain.
		base.rgb = color0.rgb * color1.rgb * color2.rgb;
